  "description": "I fell for a moment in the noble family, Youngae, and was like a maid in an acquaintance's house.  \nEva Macys, who was living her hard life,  \nShe accidentally meets her former fiancee, her Prince Edward.\n\nIt was only after her departure that he, who was strong and cold-hearted but kind to her,  \nEva comes to her realization that he is her own first love, but  \nShe gives up her current feelings, saying that this is the end of her relationship with him. (Translated by Google Translate)\n\nOriginal Webtoon\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002677)",
